## Workflow Automation

### Create Workflow

Define sequential batch workflows with fixed steps:

```javascript
mcp__flow -
  nexus__workflow_create({
    name: 'Ticket Processing',
    description: 'Batch process support tickets',
    steps: [
      { id: 'classify', action: 'classify_ticket', agent: 'researcher' },
      { id: 'research', action: 'research_solution', agent: 'researcher' },
      { id: 'generate', action: 'generate_response', agent: 'coder' },
      { id: 'send', action: 'send_response', agent: 'coder' },
