**Workflow Features:**

- **Linear Steps**: No dependency (`depends_on`) support – steps run sequentially
- **No Parallel Execution**: Each step runs one at a time
- **Event Triggers**: Only manual and cron schedule triggers
- **Retry Policies**: Simple fixed delay only
- **Priority Queuing**: Simple priority levels (no emergency queue)

